OL,3,GNEWSAPolice searching for mum of baby
OL,4,Agirl found on shoreline tell her not to
OL,5,Abe afraid to call
OL,6,
OL,7,FSupt Llinos Davies from North Wales
OL,8,FPolice said a specialist would take a
OL,9,Fcall from the woman directly and could
OL,10,Fsupport her confidentially and told the
OL,11,Fwoman not to be afraid to speak to the
OL,12,Fpolice.
